        "original_id": "945697fa-6140-57a8-bb45-5cd40ddec268",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Wu, Guy Ritchie, Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, André Benjamin, Anubhav Sinha, Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, Kanika Dhillon, Kamay Lau\n- Places: Hong Kong, Chinatown, London\n- Films: Revolver, Ra.One\n- Roles: actress, hitlady, director, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Wu was born in Hong Kong and grew up in Chinatown, London.\n- Revolver is a 2005 British-French crime thriller film co-written and directed by Guy Ritchie and starring Jason Statham, Ray Liotta, Vincent Pastore, and André Benjamin.\n- Kamay Lau is a British actress best known as the failed hitlady in Revolver.\n- Ra.One is a 2011 Indian superhero film directed by Anubhav Sinha and starring Shah Rukh Khan, Arjun Rampal, Kareena Kapoor, Armaan Verma, Shahana Goswami, and Tom Wu.\n- The script for Ra.One was written by Anubhav Sinha and Kanika Dhillon, and the idea originated when Anubhav Sinha saw a television commercial and later expanded it.",
